    "https://salem-state-university.career-pages.com/jobs/adjunct-faculty-graduate-childhood-education-care-ay-2026-2027": {
      "title": "Join our team",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty Graduate, Childhood Education & Care, AY 2026-2027 - University website My Profile Kiosk mode Join our team Adjunct Faculty Graduate, Childhood Education & Care, AY 2026-2027 Adjunct Faculty Graduate, Childhood Education & Care, AY 2026-2027 493070 443 - Childhood Education and Care Faculty: Adjunct Staff: Temporary/Contract Part-Time Closing on: Jul 23 2029 Hybrid $1,610 - $1,987 per SHCI (Semester Hours of Credit Instruction) Add to favorites View favorites Overview: Salem State University is seeking adjunct professors with interest and experience teaching elementary, early childhood, special education, or literacy courses at the graduate level and/or supervising teacher candidates in their pre-practicum or practicum. Duties and Responsibilities: Teach graduate courses and/or supervise teacher candidates in their pre-practicum or practicum. Work collaboratively with faculty, in a school with future-directed leadership and a collective focus on academic excellence, success of our students and faculty development. Required Qualifications: Master's degree Teaching experience Demonstrated commitment to collaboration and collegiality Demonstrated commitment to teaching, supervision, and advising Preferred Qualifications Appropriate terminal degree Higher education teaching and supervision experience at the graduate level Experience with online teaching and use of a learning management system, such as Canvas Working Location: Most graduate courses are delivered in an online modality. Application Instructions: Please apply online and attach CV, cover letter, and transcripts. To ensure you are assigned the highest eligible rank, you should provide the total sum of credits you have taught at the college/university level.  This information can be added to your CV, cover letter, or a separate document. Employment is contingent upon a completed background and CORI check satisfactory to the university. This position is not eligible for H1B visa sponsorship. EEO Statement: The university considers all qualified candidates without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, disability status, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation, genetic information, pregnancy or pregnancy-related condition or any other characteristic protected by law. Apply now First Name (required) bee45662 Last Name (required) ae6d8619 Email (required) 63cf9022 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Recommended jobs Adjunct Faculty Day, Healthcare Studies, AY 2025-2026 493102 723 - Healthcare Studies Faculty: Adjunct Part-Time Adjunct Faculty Evening - Continuing Education, English, AY 2026-2027 493089 163 - English Faculty: Adjunct, Staff: Temporary/Contract Part-Time Assistant Dean of Academic Advising 493046 256 - Ctr For Advising/Retention Staff: Administrator/Professional Full-Time Faculty: History, (Early American and Public History), Full-Time, Temporary 493082 190 - History Faculty: Non-Tenured Not On Track Non-Tenure-Track (Temp) Director of Academic Operations 493076 101 - Academic Affairs/ OVP Staff: Administrator/Professional Full-Time Field Placement and First-Year Advising Coordinator 493038 234 - Psychology Staff: Administrator/Professional Full-Time Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 6ba3e6ca Last Name (required) dc8b7422 Email (required) 129afa43 Job Alert 85736cef Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments 443 - Childhood Education and Care 443 - Childhood Education and Care Categories Faculty: Adjunct Staff: Temporary/Contract Faculty: Adjunct Staff: Temporary/Contract Employment Type Part-Time Part-Time Working location Hybrid Hybrid Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Apply Now First Name (required) 9d171448 Last Name (required) 1f90d